{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"分离映射"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"title":[{"Plain":"“分离映射”"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>概形的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 称为分离映射, 是指对角线 $X\\to X\\times_Y X$ 是闭映射.</p>\n<p>概形 $X$ 称为分离概形是指 $X\\to\\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathbb{Z})$ 是分离映射.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"分离几何态射","text":"分离几何态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}